### Register
POST http://localhost:5000/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:5000/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Get favourites (замінити TOKEN на реальний з відповіді логіну)
GET http://localhost:5000/favourites
Authorization: eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6MjMsImlhdCI6MTc5Mjg2MjEzMSwiZXhwIjoxNzkzNDY2OTMxfQ.YkZCO2CB8sj7MYDTu8a5MLVQxd4nl_wSQIwu0rlH_f8

### Add favourite
POST http://localhost:5000/favourites
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6MywiaWF0IjoxNzkyNjE3MDYwLCJleHAiOjE3OTMyMjE4NjB9.gMZx8J4As-TrUiqoDxg3LxwEL2FJrNK4j5setMKn4mY
